sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant AT as AccuracyTab
    participant API as fetchAIAccuracyReport
    participant MK as mockInsights(兜底)
    participant HC as HeatmapChart
    participant CS as confusionStats

    U->>AT: 进入「准确率分析」TAB
    AT->>API: GET /ai/accuracy-report
    alt 成功且非空
        API-->>AT: {overallStats, confusion:{labels,matrix}, ...}
    else 空/失败
        AT->>MK: getAccuracyReportMock()
        MK-->>AT: 同形状(含 confusion)
    end
    AT->>HC: <HeatmapChart matrix=confusion.matrix labels=confusion.labels/>
    HC->>CS: rowNormalize(matrix)
    HC->>CS: computeCramersV(matrix)
    HC->>CS: computeTopConfusionPairs(labels, matrix, 3)
    CS-->>HC: rowNormalized / cramersV / topPairs
    HC-->>U: 对角线深绿热力图 + 只标百分比 + 发散色板 + Cramér's V 摘要卡 + 下方 Top-3 混淆对

    Note over AT: 准确率概览条 buildSummaryItems(overallStats)<br/>若"混淆率"字段缺失则跳过该项(h)

---

sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant DP as DashboardPage
    participant API as fetchRealtimeMetrics
    participant ZC as ZoneCSemantic
    participant ZD as ZoneDBusiness
    participant ZE as ZoneERag
    participant MS as MiniSpark
    participant ZB as ZoneBadge

    U->>DP: 进入总览大屏
    DP->>API: GET /metrics/realtime (3s 轮询)
    API-->>DP: RealtimeMetricsVO
    DP->>ZB: 各 Zone header 渲染字母徽标 A/B/C/D/E(b)
    DP->>ZC: metrics → Zone C 3 卡
    DP->>ZD: metrics → Zone D 3 卡
    DP->>ZE: metrics → Zone E 3 卡
    ZC->>MS: 每卡 sparkData(a)
    ZD->>MS: 每卡 sparkData(a)
    ZE->>MS: 每卡 sparkData(a)
    ZE->>ZE: 按 goodWhenUp 修正环比配色(g)
    DP->>DP: Zone B「P95 系统时延」sub 补错误率 badge(c, 取 metrics.systemErrorRate ?? 0.12)

---

sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant ET as ExternalCallTab
    participant RP as RagPanel
    participant API as fetchInvocations('rag')
    participant MK as mockInsights(RAG 兜底)
    participant RQ as RagQualityChart

    U->>ET: 切到「RAG」Segmented
    ET->>RP: <RagPanel/>
    RP->>API: GET /invocations?category=rag
    alt 后端未接入(404/空)
        RP->>MK: getRagMock() → 5 子指标 + 质量分布(带 DEMO 角标)
    else 成功
        API-->>RP: 真实 RAG 指标
    end
    RP-->>U: 5 子指标 KPI + 趋势 + 检索质量子面板(Top-K 相关性分布图 RQ)

---

sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant DU as DiagnosisUnified
    participant API as fetchInsightsActions
    participant AL as ActionList
    participant N as utils/nav(itab)

    U->>DU: 进入智能诊断 TAB
    DU->>API: GET /ai/insights/actions
    API-->>DU: ActionItem[](含 tab 字段)
    DU->>AL: actions
    AL-->>U: 每条行动渲染「去{对应TAB} →」深链
    U->>AL: 点击深链
    AL->>N: itab(action.tab)
    N-->>U: 跳转到对应 AI 洞察 TAB
